{"id":"0713261a55227787aa5d131e0d679545","choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I'll analyze the task: submit a complete event plan for SH07 (林屿 self-handed reconciliation), with all original actions fully captured and clear real states, following the transport protocol.\n\nLet me construct the events based on B07 source step:\n\n- 林屿低头看明细单 → 用右手笔在第一处红批注旁落字改一笔 → 写到第二行数字停住 → 把结算单从桌角拉到明细单旁边对齐 → 比对后用笔尖在明细单第二行点一下 → 把那个数字划掉重写 → 写完一笔停一下 → 再对向结算单继续往下改\n\nStarting state for SH07:\n- C02: sitting at E02, facing toward_E01, gazing at E02_P03_Y_and_P05, holding P07 in right_hand\n- P05: at surface:E02:near_E01_edge\n- P06: at surface:E02:corner\n- P07: holder C02, location right_hand\n\nEvents plan:\n1. C02 gaze change: shift to P05 (明细单) to look down at it\n2. C02 take P07 (already in hand, but per protocol need explicit take from source) — actually P07 is already held. Per \"全部操作读取事件开始态\", since P07 starts in right_hand, no take needed. We use operation=null with gaze/face/move if no prop transfer.\n3. Place P06 from E02:corner to E02:near_E01_edge (aligning next to P05)\n4. C02 gaze/focus after alignment\n\nLet me reconsider: the user said \"手指调握/写字用null\" and \"不能把多个不同状态变化藏在null\". Each event at most one change.\n\nEvents:\n1. C02, op=gaze → actor C02, value \"at_E02_P05\" (低头看向明细单)\n2. C02, op=place P06 → actor C02, target P06, value \"surface:E02:near_E01_edge\" (把结算单从桌角拉到明细单旁边对齐)\n3. C02, op=gaze → actor C02, value \"at_E02_P05_and_P06\" (比对两份单据)\n4. C02, op=gaze → actor C02, value \"at_E02_P05_row2\" (笔尖在明细单第二行点了一下)\n5. C02, op=gaze → actor C02, value \"at_E02_P06\" (对向结算单继续往下改)\n\nWait — writing/striking actions involve P07 usage but P07 stays in hand. The actual physical changes are: gaze shifts and one place of P06.\n\nLet me re-examine the source carefully:\n\"林屿重新低头看向那张A4横版客户明细单\" → gaze to P05\n\"用右手那支签字笔在第一处红笔批注旁落字改了一笔\" → writing (P07 in hand, no prop change, gaze on P05)\n\"写到第二行数字时停住\" → gaze shift to row 2 of P05\n\"把那张A4纵版结算单从桌角拉到明细单旁边对齐\" → slide/place P06 next to P05\n\"比对后又用笔尖在明细单第二行点了一下\" → gaze on P05 row 2\n\"把那个数字划掉重写\" → writing (gaze on P05)\n\"写完一笔停一下\" → brief pause (gaze shift or null)\n\"再对向结算单继续往下改\" → gaze to P06\n\nPer \"手指调握/写字用null\" — writing itself is null operation with subject correct.\n\nPlan:\n1. intent: 低头看向明细单准备落字；subject C02；operation {kind:\"gaze\", actor:\"C02\", target:\"\", value:\"at_E02_P05\"}\n2. intent: 落字改第一处红批注；subject C02；operation null\n3. intent: 写到第二行数字时停住，目光落到第二行；subject C02；operation {kind:\"gaze\", actor:\"C02\", target:\"\", value:\"at_E02_P05_row2\"}\n4. intent: 把结算单从桌角拉到明细单旁对齐；subject C02；operation {kind:\"slide\", actor:\"C02\", target:\"P06\", value:\"surface:E02:near_E01_edge\"} (slide between surfaces on same desk from corner to near_E01_edge next to P05)\n5. intent: 比对两份单据；subject C02；operation null\n6. intent: 笔尖点在明细单第二行；subject C02；operation null (gaze remains)\n7. intent: 划掉数字重写；subject C02；operation null\n8. intent: 写完一笔停一下，目光转向结算单继续比对往下改；subject C02；operation {kind:\"gaze\", actor:\"C02\", target:\"\", value:\"at_E02_P06\"}\n\nWait, \"slide\" requires both surfaces. Per schema slide kind: actor/target/value. Value is the destination location string. Source position read from start state. Good.\n\nBut re-reading the protocol: \"take/place/slide目标是道具ID，value非空真实持有位置或surface:支持面ID:区域\". Slide from current location to new location. P06 starts at surface:E02:corner, after slide goes to surface:E02:near_E01_edge.\n\nActually wait — \"全部操作读取事件开始态\" — this means each event's operation reads the state at the BEGINNING of that event. The slide reads P06's location at start of event 4 (corner), and places it to new location. After event 4, P06 is at near_E01_edge.\n\nLet me also check: original says \"写到第二行数字时停住\" then \"把结算单拉过来对齐\". The sequence in raw is:\n1. gaze down at P05\n2. write first red note (null, P07 in hand)\n3. stop at row 2 (gaze shift)\n4. slide P06 from corner to near P05\n5. compare (null)\n6. pen tip point on row 2 of P05 (null — gaze already on P05 row2, or null)\n7. strike and rewrite (null)\n8. pause, then gaze to P06 to continue comparing/altering downward\n\nPer \"普通事件最多一个变化；同叠三张take同事件，place在后续另一事件\" — and per \"全部操作读取事件开始态\".\n\nLet me finalize:\n","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_01a10d6df0717b2191c2181f","type":"function","function":{"name":"submit_creative_json","arguments":"{\"payload_json\":\"{\\\"actions\\\":[{\\\"source_step_ref\\\":\\\"raw_linear_script.beats.6.steps.0\\\",\\\"events\\\":[{\\\"intent\\\":\\\"重新低头看向自己桌上的客户明细单，准备落字\\\",\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"operation\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"gaze\\\",\\\"actor\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"at_E02_P05\\\"},\\\"satisfies\\\":[]},{\\\"intent\\\":\\\"用右手签字笔在明细单第一处红笔批注旁落字改一笔\\\",\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"operation\\\":null,\\\"satisfies\\\":[]},{\\\"intent\\\":\\\"写到第二行数字时停住，目光落到明细单第二行\\\",\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"operation\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"gaze\\\",\\\"actor\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"at_E02_P05_row2\\\"},\\\"satisfies\\\":[]},{\\\"intent\\\":\\\"把结算单从林屿桌角拉到自己明细单旁边对齐\\\",\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"operation\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"slide\\\",\\\"actor\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"P06\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"surface:E02:near_E01_edge\\\"},\\\"satisfies\\\":[]},{\\\"intent\\\":\\\"用笔尖在明细单第二行点一下，对比结算单\\\",\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"operation\\\":null,\\\"satisfies\\\":[]},{\\\"intent\\\":\\\"把那个数字划掉重写，写完一笔停一下\\\",\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"operation\\\":null,\\\"satisfies\\\":[]},{\\\"intent\\\":\\\"再对向结算单，继续往下比对改动\\\",\\\"subject\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"operation\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"gaze\\\",\\\"actor\\\":\\\"C02\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"at_E02_P06\\\"},\\\"satisfies\\\":[]}]}]}\"}"},"index":0}]}}],"created":1791226651,"model":"MiniMax-M3","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"total_tokens":16047,"total_characters":0,"prompt_tokens":14309,"completion_tokens":1738,"completion_tokens_details":{"rea